{
  "_implementation_notes": [
    "CINNABAR ISLAND FILL -- Phase 4 (Reckoning). Remaining maps.",
    "Covers: Pokemon Center (130), PokeMart (188),",
    "Houses (125, 189, 190, 207, 219), Hotel (135, 136),",
    "Lab research (208), Lab restricted/robots (703),",
    "Lab archive/robots (721), Harbor (616, 761),",
    "Pokemon Mansion 2F (174), Pokemon Mansion 3F (181),",
    "Seafoam Islands B1 (808).",
    "",
    "Tone: Isolated, intellectual, haunted. Blaine's shadow over",
    "everything. The past reaching into the present.",
    "Lab: researchers living with legacy of Mewtwo research.",
    "Mansion: journal fragments rewritten for Synthesis lore.",
    "Hotel: tourists who came to see 'where it happened.'",
    "Harbor: functional ferry connections.",
    "",
    "PRESERVED (mechanical/quest): Nurse healing (130 E4/7),",
    "Earth Power tutor (130 E5), Dodrio trade (130 E15/16),",
    "Deliveryman (188 E3), all shelf text (188 E4-23),",
    "Alola outfit quest (188 E26), Metal Powder quest (125 E7),",
    "Fishing Guru brother (189 E3), Stealth Rock tutor (190 E1),",
    "Pokemon Psychiatrist (207 E1), Materials guide (219 E6),",
    "Hotel rest/salon (135 E5/12/13), hotel quests --",
    "Quick Powder (136 E5), Diamond Necklace (136 E8),",
    "Relic Vase (136 E9), Legendary bird tracker (208 E1/4/5/10),",
    "Robot battles (703 E1/4/5/7/8/9/10/11/12, 721 E1/4/5/10),",
    "Harbor ferries (616 E1/15), Harbor Sevii events (761 all),",
    "Mansion locked doors (174 E2-7, 181 E2-5), secret switches",
    "(174 E8, 181 E6), trainer battles (174 E1/17/22, 181 E22/23),",
    "wild encounters (181 E26), ice pick climbing (808 all),",
    "Pokemon eggs (808 E1), angry parent (808 E22),",
    "Type Expert Ice (808 E29), Blaine NPC (808 E16).",
    "",
    "REWRITTEN: Mansion journals 2F/3F (174 E18/19, 181 E24/25),",
    "mansion scientists (181 E22/23), Pokemon Center NPCs,",
    "PokeMart NPCs (188 E25), hotel flavor NPCs (135 E9),",
    "house trash checks (125 E1, 219 E1).",
    "",
    "Line length limit: ~42 characters per line."
  ],
  "maps": {
    "130": {
      "name": "Pokemon Center (Cinnabar)",
      "events": {
        "5": {
          "name": "EV005 -- Blaine Tip NPC / Earth Power Tutor",
          "pages": {
            "0": {
              "conditions": {},
              "dialogue_blocks": [
                {
                  "start_index": 1,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Have you challenged Blaine",
                    "yet? He's... intense. Not",
                    "just about fire types."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 3,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "There's something behind",
                    "his eyes. Like he's testing",
                    "you for more than a badge."
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        "6": {
          "name": "EV006 -- Blaine History NPC",
          "pages": {
            "0": {
              "conditions": {},
              "dialogue_blocks": [
                {
                  "start_index": 1,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Blaine's been here longer",
                    "than anyone remembers. He",
                    "used to run a research lab",
                    "too -- before it burned."
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        "10": {
          "name": "EV010 -- Fire Warning NPC",
          "pages": {
            "0": {
              "conditions": {},
              "dialogue_blocks": [
                {
                  "start_index": 1,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Blaine is a master of fire",
                    "types. He'll burn you if",
                    "you aren't prepared. But",
                    "the real heat on this",
                    "island isn't in the gym."
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
