                {
                  "start_index": 1,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "I saw Koga's daughter use",
                    "a move to push a boulder",
                    "in Fuchsia City."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 4,
                  "type": "text",
