    "136": {
      "name": "Cinnabar Hotel (Rooms)",
      "events": {
        "7": {
          "name": "EV007 -- Empty Room",
          "pages": {
            "0": {
              "conditions": {},
              "dialogue_blocks": [
                {
                  "start_index": 0,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Dust on everything. Nobody's",
                    "been in here for years. A",
                    "guidebook on the nightstand",
                    "is open to a page about",
                    "the Pokemon Mansion.",
                    "'Historical landmark.",
                    "Permanently closed.'"
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        "8": {
          "name": "EV008 -- Gift Seeker NPC",
          "pages": {
            "0": {
              "conditions": {},
              "dialogue_blocks": [
                {
                  "start_index": 1,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "I need to find my wife a",
                    "new anniversary gift.",
                    "There's an artisan on Knot",
                    "Island who makes jewels."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 3,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "A Diamond Necklace would",
                    "be perfect. If I can get",
                    "to the Sevii Islands,",
                    "that is. Travel's been",
                    "complicated lately."
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        "9": {
          "name": "EV009 -- Relic Vase NPC",
          "pages": {
            "0": {
              "conditions": {},
              "dialogue_blocks": [
                {
                  "start_index": 1,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "A burglar stole my Relic",
                    "Vase! A family heirloom!",
                    "He ran into the Pokemon",
                    "Mansion..."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 5,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Nobody sane goes in there.",
                    "But I suppose a burglar",
                    "isn't exactly sane."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 8,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "I'd give anything to have",
                    "it back. The mansion gives",
                    "me the creeps, but maybe",
                    "a trainer like you..."
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "174": {
      "name": "Pokemon Mansion 2F",
      "events": {
        "1": {
          "name": "Trainer(3) -- Burglar (Lost)",
          "pages": {
            "0": {
              "conditions": {},
              "dialogue_blocks": [
                {
                  "start_index": 5,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "I can't find the exit!",
                    "This place is a maze.",
                    "And the walls... did you",
                    "see the scorch marks?",
                    "Something burned through",
                    "solid steel in here."
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        "17": {
          "name": "Trainer(3) -- Burglar (Loot)",
          "pages": {
            "0": {
              "conditions": {},
              "dialogue_blocks": [
                {
                  "start_index": 5,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "There's tons of old lab",
                    "equipment in here! Some",
                    "of it's gotta be worth",
                    "something. If you can get",
                    "past the locked doors."
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        "18": {
          "name": "Journal #3 -- Year Three",
          "pages": {
            "0": {
              "conditions": {},
              "dialogue_blocks": [
                {
                  "start_index": 0,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "CINNABAR RESEARCH LOG",
                    "-- YEAR THREE",
                    "Dr. Blaine, presiding."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 1,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Two years of successful",
                    "trials. Twenty-seven new",
                    "stable hybrid species.",
                    "The League wants a public",
                    "rollout -- controlled,",
                    "licensed, but public."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 2,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "The Mew template isn't",
                    "just a blueprint for",
                    "fusion. It's a blueprint",
                    "for creation. Giovanni",
                    "sees it. He's doubled his",
                    "funding. The project has",
                    "a name now: SYNTHESIS."
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        "19": {
          "name": "Journal #4 -- Year Four",
          "pages": {
            "0": {
              "conditions": {},
              "dialogue_blocks": [
                {
                  "start_index": 0,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "CINNABAR RESEARCH LOG",
                    "-- YEAR FOUR",
                    "Dr. Blaine, presiding."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 1,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Fourteen failed attempts",
                    "at full synthesis. The",
                    "genetic template breaks",
                    "past a certain threshold."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 2,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Three viable but malformed",
                    "specimens. One appears to",
                    "be a new species -- shape-",
                    "less, gelatinous, but",
                    "alive. Hashimoto calls it",
                    "'Ditto.'"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 3,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Kimura quit. Called it",
                    "'unconscionable.' Giovanni",
                    "is losing patience -- he",
                    "wants a weapon, not a",
                    "paper. His money is the",
                    "only timeline that matters."
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        "22": {
          "name": "TYPE_EXPERT_FIRE -- Scientist",
          "pages": {
            "1": {
              "conditions": { "self_switch": "D" },
              "dialogue_blocks": [
                {
                  "start_index": 1,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "I came here to study what",
                    "Blaine left behind. The",
                    "equipment, the notes...",
                    "Most of it's destroyed,",
                    "but fragments remain."
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "181": {
      "name": "Pokemon Mansion 3F",
      "events": {
        "22": {
          "name": "Trainer(4) -- Fusion Scientist",
          "pages": {
            "0": {
              "conditions": {},
              "dialogue_blocks": [
                {
                  "start_index": 5,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "I found notes about a",
                    "fusion formula in here.",
                    "Not the standard kind.",
                    "Something deeper. Something",
                    "that wasn't meant to be",
                    "found."
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        "23": {
          "name": "Trainer(4) -- Mentor Scientist",
          "pages": {
            "0": {
              "conditions": {},
              "dialogue_blocks": [
                {
                  "start_index": 5,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "My mentor worked in this",
                    "building, years ago. Part",
                    "of the original team. He",
                    "never talked about what",
                    "happened. Not once."
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        "24": {
          "name": "Journal #6 -- Year Five (Reckoning)",
          "pages": {
            "0": {
              "conditions": {},
              "dialogue_blocks": [
                {
                  "start_index": 0,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "CINNABAR RESEARCH LOG",
                    "-- YEAR FIVE, MONTH 7",
                    "Dr. Blaine, presiding."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 1,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Five months since birth.",
                    "Mewtwo's power still",
                    "rising. The containment",
                    "rated for 8,000 units",
                    "now holds something at",
                    "47,000. And climbing."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 2,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Giovanni arrived with",
                    "engineers. He wants",
                    "'behavioral restraints.'",
                    "Neural dampeners. I said",
                    "no. He reminded me who",
                    "pays the bills."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 3,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Mewtwo responds to speech.",
                    "Novel responses. It asked",
                    "Hashimoto a question. He",
                    "went home early. Addendum:",
                    "It doesn't have 'vicious",
                    "tendencies.' It responds",
                    "to fear with fear. To",
                    "cages with rage. We'd call",
                    "this cruelty in any other",
                    "creature."
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        "25": {
          "name": "Journal #5 -- Year Five (Birth)",
          "pages": {
            "0": {
              "conditions": {},
              "dialogue_blocks": [
                {
                  "start_index": 0,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "CINNABAR RESEARCH LOG",
                    "-- YEAR FIVE, MONTH 2",
                    "Dr. Blaine, presiding."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 1,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "It worked. Successful full",
                    "synthesis. I'm calling it",
                    "Mewtwo, because it",
                    "deserves a name."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 2,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Psychic readings are off",
                    "the scale. We recalibrated",
                    "twice. Power output on day",
                    "one exceeds every recorded",
                    "Pokemon. By a factor of",
                    "six."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 3,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "The team celebrated.",
                    "Giovanni called about",
                    "'practical applications.'",
                    "I hung up. Went back alone",
                    "late at night. Mewtwo",
                    "floated in growth fluid,",
                    "still forming. Its eyes",
                    "were open. Watching me.",
                    "I told myself that was",
                    "just a reflex."
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
